WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:02.840
Find your next research opportunity,

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:04.243
or post a position.

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.590
Browse research jobs, grants, and scholarships.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:10.570
Filter by topic or country.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:15.780
Choose an individual or organization account.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.485
Then select your role and set up your profile.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.800
Add a photo, your research interests, and your links.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.428
Manage your files and privacy here, too.

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:29.380
Draft a position for your lab.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:32.595
It goes live once your institution is verified.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:36.400
Compare grants, save deadlines to your calendar,

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.075
and track your applications.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.020
Find collaborators in Discovery.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:45.620
Once they accept your introduction, you can message privately.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.230
Ask the Research Assistant.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:50.714
Explore connections in the Evidence Graph.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:54.443
Check official sources and conference credentials.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.226
Pick a link below to get started.
